{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">9月25日，北京见！</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">2025京东全球科技探索者大会重磅来袭，诚邀您共赴科技盛宴！<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">京东物流</a>独家承办&ldquo;智驭未来&rdquo;智能物流分论坛，将深度聚焦大模型、具身智能等前沿技术，战略性全景呈现AI在物流全链路的创新突破与实践成果。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">本次分论坛上，我们将重磅发布京东物流超脑大模型 2.0 &amp; 京东物流异狼具身智能机械臂，向行业展示世界级突破的最新技术。此外，还有行业顶级专家深度分享，共同揭秘物流AI新范式。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">热切期待您的莅临，与我们携手记录 AI 技术赋能物流供应链产业升级的关键时刻，共启智能新未来！</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1758505328197.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1758505332088.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1758505337357.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1758505341979.png\" /></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content02944", "contentTitle": "2025京东全球科技探索者大会重磅来袭，诚邀您共赴“智驭未来”科技盛宴！", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1758504759000, "id": 6667, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1758505346410.png", "updateTime": 1758505734000}}